{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lunar Drifter</strong> is an arcade first person shooter heavily inspired by <i>The Mercenaries</i> minigame from the <i>Resident Evil</i> series. Tear apart the highest amount of enemies possible while running and gunning to keep yourself alive, while finding clocks and hourglasses to give yourself precious extra seconds and make the most of your limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/12e7b78b6d15bcf81255022fed373e3f.poster.avif?t=1772441048\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/12e7b78b6d15bcf81255022fed373e3f.webm?t=1772441048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/12e7b78b6d15bcf81255022fed373e3f.mp4?t=1772441048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the ultimate legion killer. Aim precisely, move fast, heal up, and do not let the combo break!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/06f0be7afc615f52df3a81295dc3bb28.poster.avif?t=1772441048\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/06f0be7afc615f52df3a81295dc3bb28.webm?t=1772441048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/06f0be7afc615f52df3a81295dc3bb28.mp4?t=1772441048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 4 playable characters have their own unique play style. Engage at long range with snipers, run and gun with pistols and smgs, or face the enemy in close quarters with sledgehammers and shotguns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the chaos, more dangerous it will be, the enemies will get all kinds of backup varying from infantry, choppers, tanks, and even the undead.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURING:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different playable characters with their own gimmicks and arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+10 unique hand-crafted levels, from Greek Temples, Moroccan castles, to the Moon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode, free play and endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loadout customization, offering different weapons and variants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards, to compete with the best of the best or challenge your friends' scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op up to 4 players, experience the chaos with friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of customization options, including crosshairs, viewmodel positioning,  and much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support with aim assist and input rebindings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3115490?t=1772441048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772441048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/078867f80ecc33be0853a1ca78fc9a0db3a90c5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772441048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/078867f80ecc33be0853a1ca78fc9a0db3a90c5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772441048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Lunar Drifter contains plenty of explicit blood, gore, and gibbing of the game's enemies.\r\nViewer discretion is advised."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3465020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lunar Drifter</strong> is an arcade first person shooter heavily inspired by <i>The Mercenaries</i> minigame from the <i>Resident Evil</i> series. Tear apart the highest amount of enemies possible while running and gunning to keep yourself alive, while finding clocks and hourglasses to give yourself precious extra seconds and make the most of your limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/12e7b78b6d15bcf81255022fed373e3f.poster.avif?t=1772441048\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/12e7b78b6d15bcf81255022fed373e3f.webm?t=1772441048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/12e7b78b6d15bcf81255022fed373e3f.mp4?t=1772441048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the ultimate legion killer. Aim precisely, move fast, heal up, and do not let the combo break!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/06f0be7afc615f52df3a81295dc3bb28.poster.avif?t=1772441048\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/06f0be7afc615f52df3a81295dc3bb28.webm?t=1772441048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/extras/06f0be7afc615f52df3a81295dc3bb28.mp4?t=1772441048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 4 playable characters have their own unique play style. Engage at long range with snipers, run and gun with pistols and smgs, or face the enemy in close quarters with sledgehammers and shotguns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the chaos, more dangerous it will be, the enemies will get all kinds of backup varying from infantry, choppers, tanks, and even the undead.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURING:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different playable characters with their own gimmicks and arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+10 unique hand-crafted levels, from Greek Temples, Moroccan castles, to the Moon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode, free play and endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loadout customization, offering different weapons and variants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards, to compete with the best of the best or challenge your friends' scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op up to 4 players, experience the chaos with friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of customization options, including crosshairs, viewmodel positioning,  and much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support with aim assist and input rebindings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["RoseHoodGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115490/header.jpg?t=1772441048","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3115490/549156020/b31875051c41331c85580cf565ee973c41e1fb28/1759607654/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759757363","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3115490/549156020/b31875051c41331c85580cf565ee973c41e1fb28/1759607654/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759757363","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3115490/549156020/b31875051c41331c85580cf565ee973c41e1fb28/1759607654/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759757363","id":257212334,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257212334/acbafc9a7341d68cc8057fc2de332ff62286c13f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17597573